msgid ""
"Mean turbidity, which is a key indicator of water clarity, quantifying the "
"haziness of the water and acting as an indicator of underwater light "
"availability. Here TMEAN is derived from total suspended matter (TSM) "
"estimates."
msgstr ""
"Turbidité moyenne, indicateur clé de la clarté de l'eau, quantifiant le "
"trouble de l'eau et servant d'indicateur de la lumière disponible sous "
"l'eau. Ici, TMEAN est dérivée des estimations de matières en suspension "
"totales (TSM)."

msgid ""
"Trophic State Index, referring to the degree at which organic matter "
"accumulates in the water body and is most commonly used in relation to "
"monitoring eutrophication. Here TSI is derived from phytoplankton biomass "
"by proxy of chlorophyll-a."
msgstr ""
"Indice d'état trophique, qui renvoie au degré d'accumulation de matière "
"organique dans le plan d'eau et est le plus souvent utilisé pour surveiller "
"l'eutrophisation. Ici, le TSI est dérivé de la biomasse phytoplanctonique "
"par l'intermédiaire de la chlorophylle-a."

msgid ""
"Total suspended matter (TSM) in g/m³, used to quantify the concentration of "
"suspended particles in the water body."
msgstr ""
"Matières en suspension totales (TSM) en g/m³, utilisées pour quantifier la "
"concentration de particules en suspension dans le plan d'eau."

